  "concerns": [
    "The complete negated quotation predicate is d3, not a standalone false null or an invented positive stem.",
    "brten nas and 'byung 'gyur na together recast dependency/arising as circumstances cause; omit individual atoms instead of treating an intransitive arising verb as a causative verb. gzugs/form and gzhan/another remain separately sound.",
    "kha spos pas means transferring/application of the same argument. Its auto-aligned HGM entry ugliness together master dharmakirti is positional contamination, not a license; omit the distributed can be used atom. C03:487/P1:107 transfer wording is corroborative only for the shared transfer expression.",
    "gnas kyang, numerical gnyis where a pair is coordinated, pronoun/genitive scaffolding, final gzugs before attractiveness/ugliness and the final phyir are distributed or compressed. Omit rather than declare no contribution.",
    "Review der thal/complete asserted-fact phrase, causal pas/Because of this and zer na/claim-introduction; these are grammatical recasts, not dictionary definitions.",
    "C15:420 matches ACIP and Wylie; English differs at non-Buddhist versus non- Buddhist. Original C05 physical source has a line break after non-. Keep the published/corpus bytes and do not label the entire pair byte-identical.",
    "No new erratum; following bracketed work title and religious classification are original English apparatus and not mapped to source content words."
